{
  "id": 1464,
  "description": "## ** Idle Bandits: Fortune Favors the Lawless **\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n- Oh, how the life of an outlaw takes its toll on one&#039;s soul. They say the world is full of opportunity, but we&#039;ve learned that fortune rarely comes to those who wait.\n- Across these vast lands lie villages overflowing with riches, merchants hoarding their wares, and adventurers carrying treasures they foolishly believe are theirs to keep.\n- We see things a little differently.\n- Why spend a lifetime earning what can be taken in a moment? Gold, materials, rare treasures... if we want it, we&#039;ll find a way to claim it.\n- Some call us thieves. Others call us scoundrels. But across these lands, one name is whispered with equal parts fear and respect...\n *_No kings. No masters. No honor among thieves. Just outlaws chasing fortune, one raid at a time._*\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n### 🏆 OUR GOALS 🏆 \n\n- ***🥇 Have fun and make friends***\n\n- ***⚔️ Win Guild Challenges &amp; Assaults***\n\n- ***📈 Improve every season***\n\n- ***👑 Reach the top — and stay there***\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n### ⚜️ WHAT WE EXPECT⚜️\n\n-  Consistency and a desire to have fun! if you&#039;re active, you&#039;re in! 🙌                                                     \n\n-  Progression-focused players\n\n-  Guild Challenge participation\n\n-  Full Assault preparation &amp; participation\n\n-  Teamwork, communication &amp; respect\n\n- No unnecessary drama\n\n- One character per person (Unless there is an event and we have free space)\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n### DISCORD \n- [***https://discord.gg/ewwM7bDusB***]\n- World Boss and Shrine Tier notifications \n- Giveaways\n- All the normal stuff guilds have in discord\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n### RAIDS\n- ### Everyday schedule:\n- Combat level 40:    12:00PM CT\n- Combat level 60:    2:00PM CT\n- Combat level 70:    4:00PM CT\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n### Top Contributor Recognition Program\n- ### (You must be in the guild discord to receive guild activity rewards)\n- *_The three highest-performing members, determined by guild contributions, deposits, and raid participation, will receive special rewards. Based on a market-value point system guild members will be rewarded points throughout the month on_* \n- 1000 gold = 1 point \n- 10000 gold = 10 points\n- Guild raid participation = 25 points \n    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n- 🥇 1 30-day membership pack  \n- 🥈 150k gold and 500 CGWS (Cooked Great White Shark)\n- 🥉 100k gold and 250 CGWS\n\n𝘋𝘪𝘴𝘤𝘭𝘢𝘪𝘮𝘦𝘳 : 𝘈𝘭𝘭 𝘪𝘯𝘧𝘰𝘳𝘮𝘢𝘵𝘪𝘰𝘯 𝘪𝘴 𝘴𝘶𝘣𝘫𝘦𝘤𝘵 𝘵𝘰 𝘤𝘩𝘢𝘯𝘨𝘦 𝘸𝘪𝘵𝘩𝘰𝘶𝘵 𝘱𝘳𝘪𝘰𝘳 𝘯𝘰𝘵𝘪𝘤𝘦.",
